    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO Donnellan and Joyce are delighted to offer for sale this four-bedroom mid terrace duplex property in the popular Gort Na Coiribe development located on the Headford Road, Galway.\n\nBuilt by premier builders O Malley Construction in the early 2000's. The development is comprised a mixture of townhouses and apartments.\n\nGort Na Coiribe is one of the University of Galway's main student residences and has a 100% occupancy rate during the academic year with the benefit of short-term lettings during the Summer months.\n\nThe property is offered to the market with vacant possession, or it can be leased through the pooled scheme managed by M&C Properties.\n\nNo 19 Gort Na Coiribe provides a central location accessible to all modern amenities and is perfectly positioned within walking distance of Galway City, The University of Galway and UCHG.\n\nThe property is presented in turnkey condition with accommodation over two floors. On entering it offers an entrance hall, a large open plan lounge, kitchen and dining room, a downstairs bedroom & W.C. \n\nThe upper floor offers three additional bedrooms, all of which are fine sizes & presented in excellent condition along with a main bathroom.\n\nExternally the complex is well maintained with ample communal parking, well maintained common areas, green spaces, mature trees, and shrubbery \n \nSituated on the doorstep of Gort Na Coiribe is the extensive Terryland Forest Park and the river Corrib. Frequent transport links also give easy access to Galway City Centre and surrounding suburbs.\n \nAdditionally, the development is well serviced by local amenities including several shopping centres and retail parks within 5 minutes' walk such as Terryland Retail Park, Dunnes Stores & Galway Shopping Centre. \n\nNo. 19 Gort Na Coiribe is an ideal student rental and a gilt-edge investment opportunity, with a strong rental yield.\n\nGold shield electric storage heating, balcony to rear and PVC double glazed windows are but a mere sample of the added extras on offer throughout this wonderful property.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and guaranteed not to disappoint.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
